---
layout: page.njk
title: Gifts
cloth: sky
intro: Having you there is the real gift. If you'd like to give something too, we're saving for a trip back to Japan.
---
<h2>{{ gifts.fund.title }}</h2>
{%- for p in gifts.fund.text %}
<p>{{ p }}</p>
{%- endfor %}
<ul class="trip-photos">
  {%- for ph in gifts.fund.photos %}
  <li{% if ph.wide %} class="wide"{% endif %}><img src="/assets/photos/{{ ph.file }}" alt="{{ ph.alt }}" sizes="(min-width: 40rem) {{ '38rem' if ph.wide else '19rem' }}, {{ '92vw' if ph.wide else '46vw' }}" eleventy:widths="480,960,1600"></li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
<p class="meta">The proposal, at the Naruto park near Mt. Fuji.</p>

<h2>Ways to give</h2>
<div class="give">
  <section class="give-way" aria-labelledby="give-venmo">
    <h3 id="give-venmo">Venmo</h3>
    <p>Send to either of us.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      {%- for v in gifts.venmo %}
      <a class="btn" href="https://venmo.com/u/{{ v.handle }}">{{ v.name }}: @{{ v.handle }}</a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="give-way" aria-labelledby="give-zelle">
    <h3 id="give-zelle">Zelle</h3>
    <p>Open your banking app, choose Zelle, and scan this code. It should show {{ gifts.zelle.name }}'s name before you send.</p>
    {#- A QR code has to stay pixel-exact, so it skips the image resizing. #}
    <img class="qr" src="{{ gifts.zelle.qr }}" alt="Zelle QR code for sending to {{ gifts.zelle.name }}" width="668" height="668" eleventy:ignore>
    <p class="meta">On your phone already? Press and hold the code to save it, then upload it in your banking app's Zelle scanner.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="give-way" aria-labelledby="give-day">
    <h3 id="give-day">At the wedding</h3>
    <p>A card or a check on the day is just as welcome.</p>
  </section>
</div>
